<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fairfax year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fairfax year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  117.81  vs 151.61</p>
<p>    Net				    73.94  vs  87.43</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    6.00  vs   6.00</p>
<p>NOTE: John Fairfax Holdings Ltd is a newspaper publisher. It is about 22 percent owned by Brierley Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     9.50 vs   9.50</p>
<p>    Sales				1,022.48 vs 995.06</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.40 vs  11.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.28 vs  10.99</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 16.40 vs  21.93 loss</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 17</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 3</p>
<p>    Tax				     27.45 vs 42.20</p>
<p>    Interest				67.95 vs 44.98</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  68.13 vs 41.54</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.02 vs  0.05</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
